       "blockName": "Prose Two",
       "children": [],
       "classes": [],
       "customAttributes": {},
       "element": "p",
       "innerHTML": "The studio grew the slow way: one commission recommending the next. First objects, then whole rooms, then the photographs and words that carry them. We hire slowly, keep the tools sharp and the egos blunted, and close for August like civilised people.",
       "mobileStyles": {},
       "rawStyles": {},
       "tabletStyles": {}
      },
      {
       "attributes": {},
       "baseStyles": {
        "color": "var(--e7a94b53-2d18-4f60-a927-8b5e3d1c4003, #837D72)",
